Subject: [DISCUSS] typo in state-change.log file name
To: dev <dev@kafka.apache.org>, Kafka Users <users@kafka.apache.org>, 
	Mickael Maison <mickael.maison@gmail.com>, Christo Lolov <christololov@gmail.com>
