Hi Chia-Ping,

Thanks for the great suggestion.

chia_02: If the node is nonexistent, the API throws =
BrokerIdNotRegisteredException.
I added related test cases to test plan.

chia_03: Added KIP-1180 to alternatives section.

Thanks,
PoAn

