ime related to plugin loading.
>=20
> In version 3.5.1, plugin discovery completed in 30-40 seconds. After u=
pgrading to 4.0.0, the same step takes over 5 minutes. We also tested ve=
rsion 3.9.0, where the delay was still 40 seconds.
>=20
> We were able to work around this issue by explicitly setting:
>=20
> plugin.discovery =3D service_load
>=20
> This brought the startup time back to expected levels. Still, we=E2=80=
=99d like to better understand:
>=20
>   1.  What might be causing the longer discovery times in newer versio=
ns?
>   2.  Is this expected behavior, or might it be a regression?
>   3.  Are there any risks to relying on service_load for plugin discov=
ery?
>=20
> Any insights or suggestions would be greatly appreciated.
> Thanks in advance,
> Love Almgren
