Hi,
Thanks for your comments on the KIP and sorry for the delay in responding.

D01: Authorisation is the area of this KIP that I think is most tricky. The=
 reason that I didn't implement specific
ACLs for DLQs because I was not convinced they would help. So, if you have =
a specific idea in mind, please
let me know. This is the area that I'm least comfortable with in the KIP.

I suppose maybe to set the DLQ name for a group, you could need a higher le=
vel of authorisation
than just ALTER_CONFIGS on the GROUP. But what I settled with in the KIP wa=
s that DLQ topics
all start with the same prefix, defaulting to "dlq.", and that the topics d=
o not automatically create.

D02: I can see that. I've added a config which I've called errors.deadlette=
rqueue.auto.create.topics.enable
just to have a consistent prefix on all of the config names. Let me know wh=
at you think.

D03: I've added some text about failure scenarios when attempting to write =
records to the DLQ.

Thanks,
Andrew
