Hi all,

I would like to start a discussion for KIP-1184 -
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/vomKFQ
This KIP proposes adding connector name and task index tags to
MirrorSourceConnector and MirrorCheckpointConnector metrics to prevent
collisions in the kafka-metrics-count metric.

Please take a look and feel free to let me know if you have any feedback.

Thanks,
Yung

