Hello all,

I=E2=80=99ve started implementing this KIP, and there are a few =
configurations that need further discussion:

1. Header=46rom fields
This configuration should allow duplicate values. Therefore, its default =
value=20
should be set to NO_DEFAULT_VALUE, and its validator should be =
NonEmptyListValidator().=20
See the test case [1] for reference.

2. bootstrap.servers
If we set its default value to NO_DEFAULT_VALUE and use the validator =
ConfigDef.ValidList.anyNonDuplicateValues(false, false),=20
initialization will fail because the default value does not pass the =
validator. I see two possible solutions:

Option 2.1: Set the default value to List.of("localhost:9092") (similar =
to WorkerConfig) and use the validator =
ConfigDef.ValidList.anyNonDuplicateValues(false, false). However, this =
feels a bit odd, as the default value=20
should ideally be useful, and localhost:9092 is not meaningful for most =
scenarios.

Option 2.2: Keep the default value as NO_DEFAULT_VALUE and use =
NonEmptyListValidator(). In this case,=20
we would need to move NonEmptyListValidator from the connect.transforms =
module to the client module,=20
and make it a public API within ConfigDef. This would also align with =
how most bootstrap.servers configs are handled.

3. Remove Cast fields config change
This configuration has its own validator, so we should leave it =
unchanged.

