This version fixes the most direct grammatical errors while keeping the
original style.

Hi Martin,

We have seen produce latency below 1s P99, and we can confidently bring it
to under 500ms. As with traditional Kafka, it all depends on throughput,
distribution, batch sizes,... In the diskless case, if there is enough
throughput, we can achieve lower produce latency.

We are working on some improvements at the moment and will share benchmarks
for different throughput scenarios in the near future.

Best,


