Hi all,

I would like to start a discussions on KIP-1205: Improve RecordHeader to be
Thread-Safe:

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1205%3A+Improve+RecordHeader+to+be+Thread-Safe

This proposal uses double-checked locking and volatile to make RecordHeader
thread-safe.


Best,
Ming-Yen

