Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 20:29:31 +0800
References: <CAA7QASE1tmrEh-w5RFDaRj5oGNDtUnHSyi5QaHU3n5N5xwp=VA@mail.gmail.com>
 <pony-4194fc7b-f57b-457f-9d70-7110910b7544-dev@kafka.apache.org>
