 Hello everyone,

I=E2=80=99ve prepared a small POC to explore an option for disabling the au=
tomatic
creation of internal topics in Kafka Connect. The goal is to validate
whether this approach could help in scenarios where internal topics contain
information about many connectors, and accidental removal or renaming of
topics in the configuration causes issues.

The pull request with description:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20384

I=E2=80=99d appreciate your review and feedback on the idea, the proposed b=
ehavior,
and the configuration approach before moving forward with a full
implementation.

