Hi PoAn,
This is truly a valuable KIP! It will be helpful for efficient real-time =
storage management. The previous comments and your thoughtful responses =
have already refined the proposal quite well.

I do have one minor scenario to bring to your attention. There could be =
a situation where there is a delay in remote log size updating. This =
implies that not only are there still segments present in local storage, =
but also the size information not precisely up-to-date. This is highly =
dependent on the update mechanism of the storage calculation in remote =
storage.

Overall, great work on this KIP and looking forward to its further =
progress.

Best,
Jimmy Wang

