Hello all,
I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1206: Strict max fetch records =
in share fetch.=20
This KIP introduces the AcquireMode in ShareFetchRequest, which provides =
two options: Strict or loose.  When strict mode is selected, we should =
only acquire records till maxFetchRecords.

=
KIP:https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1206:+Strict+max=
+fetch+records+in+share+fetch

Thanks,
Jimmy Wang=

