Hello all,
I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1206: Strict max fetch records in=
 share fetch.
This KIP introduces the AcquireMode in ShareFetchRequest, which provides tw=
o options: Strict or loose.  When strict mode is selected, we should only a=
cquire records till maxFetchRecords.

KIP:https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1206:+Strict+max+=
fetch+records+in+share+fetch

Thanks,
Jimmy Wang

