Thanks Eduwer for reporting this problem...

It's a regression bug, introduced with 
https://github.com/apache/kafka/commit/f13a22af0b3a48a4ca1bf2ece5b58f31e3b26b7d

The commit is doing some internal refactoring/cleanup, to just reverting 
the commit should be fine: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20398

I believe, we need a new RC...


I created https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19638 as blocker 
for 4.2 release, to fix-forward.


-Matthias

