Hello all,=20

I have updated the KIP with following changes

1. HeaderFrom.headers should allow duplicate values, so I have removed =
it from the KIP.=20
FYI, the reference test case[1].

2. The log.dir configuration already allows multiple values under the =
existing logic [2].=20
Therefore, we propose updating its type from STRING to LIST, changing =
the default=20
value from "/tmp/kafka-logs" to List.of("/tmp/kafka-logs"). In addition, =
we update its=20
validator from null to anyNonDuplicateValues(isNullAllowed =3D true, =
isEmptyAllowed =3D false).

