Dear Sir,

Kahyx is pleased to extend funding solutions for
business expansion and project development through long-term debt
financing. We offer loan facilities with terms ranging from 10 to
25 years, inclusive of a 12-month grace period, at a highly
competitive fixed interest rate of 3% per annum.

We also welcome collaborations with qualified brokers and
introducers. A 2% commission on the total loan amount is paid to
 intermediaries who successfully connect eligible project owners
to our firm.

Should you require further information or wish to explore this
opportunity, please do not hesitate to reach out directly.

Warm regards,
Mr. Eric Herbert
Director, Corporate Finance & Lending
Kahyx Capital
