---------------------------------------

             Summary: Improve RebalanceProtocolMigrationIntegrationTest
                 Key: KAFKA-19657
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19657
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams, unit tests
    Affects Versions: 4.2.0
